{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>Your cities a ruin.</b> Corresponding to 'and they shall pursue among you' — and it is the fourth." "<b>And I will lay waste your sanctuaries.</b> Corresponding to 'and I will set My dwelling in your midst' — and it is the fifth." "<b>And I will not smell the savor of your soothing odors.</b> Corresponding to 'and I will walk in your midst' — and it is the sixth."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:15:36.848621008Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}